% intensional.trees — modality and attitudes (use with intensional.lex)
dedicto:    [S John [VP believes [CP that [S [DP a spy] [VP left]]]]]
seek:       [S John [VP seeks [DP a unicorn]]]
modal:      [S must [S [DP every student] [VP leave]]]
might:      [S might [S Mary [VP leave]]]
factive:    [S John [VP knows [CP that [S Mary [VP left]]]]]
negfactive: [S John [VP doesn't [VP know [CP that [S Mary [VP left]]]]]]
